// PAS-DEBT-B2-010b Slice B (#1541, v0.36.65) — round-trip fixture.
//
// Trivial identity macro. Under Slice B's structured template
// expansion, the invocation `id(42)` composes into the source `{ 42 }`
// and re-lexes into LBrace + Int + RBrace tokens. The parser produces
// pattern_elems `[Fragment("x", expr)]` and template_elems
// `[Literal("{ "), Fragment("$x"), Literal(" }")]`; `expand_macro`
// substitutes the fragment binding to yield the expanded source.
//
// End-to-end code-emission coverage waits on the macro-driver work
// (PAS-DEBT-B7-001, #1529) that wires expand_macro into the pass
// pipeline; this fixture documents the intended shape today.

module M = structure {
  macro id($x:expr) => { $x }
}
